.TH ihex_record_address 3
.SH NAME
ihex_record_address \- resolve Intel HEX record address
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "ihex.h"
.PP
.BI "int ihex_record_address(ihex_record *" rec ", ihex_addr *" addr ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ihex_record_address
extracts the base address from a special Intel HEX record (such as type 4
Extended Linear Address) and populates the
.I addr
structure.